        <h2 id="cost-comparison">Cost Comparison of Aerosol Propellants (India vs Global)</h2>
        <p>Propellant cost significantly influences aerosol product pricing, especially in high-volume FMCG and industrial markets. In India, LPG remains the lowest-cost option due to domestic refining and wide infrastructure. DME is moderately higher in cost, while HFCs are substantially more expensive due to import dependency and regulatory costs.</p>

